<title>UK: UK Nursing Home Props in 18 mln stg buy.</title>
<headline>UK Nursing Home Props in 18 mln stg buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nursing Home Properties Plc said on Tuesday it is to buy 11 nursing and residential homes with 527 beds for 16.828 million stg.</p>
<p>The UK group, which specialises in the purchase and leaseback of modern purpose built nursing homes, has also exchanged contracts on the purchase of another residential home with 30 beds for 930,000 stg. In total the acquisitions are worth 17.758 million stg.</p>
</text>
